tools.description:
FX bars. Use for currency context.

        pair like 'USDVND'. summary/columns: summary returns {count,last,high,low}
        only; columns keeps named fields.

Bid/ask depth. Use for microstructure reads.

        depth: levels per side (default 3). Equity symbols return live depth;
        VN30F1M futures book is usually empty upstream — use vn_trades tape.

Disclosures feed as corporate actions. Use for dividend/meeting scans.

        symbol: omit for VN overview; limit: max disclosures. Raw feed;
        company_events classifies the same disclosures into kinds.
